%% Figure: YouTube OAuth 2.0 authorization-code flow + analytics sync
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Social-Media Lead
    participant UI as Founder OS (SPA)
    participant Start as youtube-oauth-start
    participant Google as Google OAuth + YouTube APIs
    participant CB as youtube-oauth-callback
    participant Sync as youtube-analytics-sync
    participant DB as Supabase DB

    User->>UI: Connect YouTube
    UI->>Start: invoke (startup_id)
    Start-->>UI: Google consent URL (scopes + state)
    UI->>Google: redirect to consent screen
    User->>Google: grant access
    Google-->>CB: redirect with auth code + state
    CB->>Google: exchange code for access + refresh token
    Google-->>CB: tokens
    CB->>DB: store tokens in connector_credentials
    User->>UI: Sync analytics
    UI->>Sync: invoke (startup_id)
    Sync->>DB: read refresh token
    Sync->>Google: refresh token -> access token
    Sync->>Google: query Data + Analytics API (per channel)
    Google-->>Sync: views, watch-time, retention, audience
    Sync->>DB: UPSERT connector_data_youtube_* + metrics
    Sync-->>UI: counts (channels, videos, rows)
